Subject: [PATCH] Calmer typography: Plus Jakarta Sans everywhere, more space

- One typeface (Plus Jakarta Sans) for landing and app; serif/italic accents become quiet grey; mono labels become small spaced caps
- Remove intro counter and custom cursor; no terminal-style captions
- Smaller, calmer headings, larger body text with more line height
- Unix Creative Studio links to unixcreativestudio.com

